; RIFT BOSS POOL (sl-0180): DECEL WALL — a seven-bolt 90° arc that
; launches quick (6.5 t/s) and bleeds speed (−4.5 t/s²), hanging
; near-still before it fades (ttl 80). The room slowly fills with
; drifting stars; the 15° spacing keeps walkable lanes at every
; range. DECELERATE's first hostile use; bot-projected closed-form.
; Pattern id 34; lead 30 (the fan danger class). Elite amber.

